<title>USA: U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soyoil weekly export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 16,800 MT were the result of increases for unknown destinations (14,000 MT), Haiti (4,800 MT), and Mexico (100 MT) being partially offset by reductions of 2,000 MT for Panama.</p>
<p>Exports of 35,900 MT were to China (28,400 MT), Mexico (3,100 MT), Haiti (2,500 MT), and Egypt (1,900 MT).</p>
</text>
